# 19. Performance

- Server-side pagination
- Debounced search
- Infinite scrolling (optional)
- Parallel loading of queue and statistics
- Lazy loading of attachments
- Attachment preview on demand
- Queue refresh every 60 seconds

---

# 20. Development Rules

- Verification Center must never modify portfolio collections directly.
- All review actions must go through the Verification Service.
- Student portfolio data is read-only.
- Every review action must publish a domain event.
- Review history is immutable.
- Queue statistics must come from backend aggregation.
- Search, filtering, and pagination must be server-side.

